docs {
**List fax history**
The faxes sent from one of your fax numbers, newest first, with cursor paging. from and to are unix seconds (from is the newer edge); the default range is the last 24 hours. status filters by job state; active means not yet finished.

OperationId: `faxesHistory`
}
